Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 22 \N {\fs100}Today's Fate {本日の運命の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.96,0:00:15.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It's morning in the Hermit Village.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.58,0:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rat, {think it's https://jisho.org/word/%E5%AD%90-1}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.86,0:00:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Cow,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bird. {???????????? no sign for this one so maybe it's not a real word at all, but will put tiger just in case}{think it's 酉}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.57,0:00:38.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Telling everyone's fortune for today \Nis a part of Elder's daily routine.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.99,0:00:41.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But I have to wonder if it'll come true.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one for those born \Nin the year of the rat.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.76,0:01:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.50,0:01:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"Be wary of mistakes today"?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.99,0:01:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What nonsense! \NThis shouldn't be on the year of the rat! {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.51,0:01:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Year of the dog, doors on all sides are closed today, \Nbeware of three terrible misfortunes.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.27,0:01:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Elder is losing his knack.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.97,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senior Disciple, \Nlet's both tell each other's fortune.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.02,0:01:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, what's that? You'll be surrounded by beauties \Non all sides, expect three great fortunes! {??????? some variation on the fortune they've read previously on the board}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.05,0:01:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.99,0:01:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll try to see your fortune now.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.38,0:01:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Year of the rat, today... \Neverything will go your way. Everything! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.49,0:01:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, incredible!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.05,0:01:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's better! Attaway!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.06,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senior Disciple, let's go all out today.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.44,0:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I might go play pachinko or mahjong!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.54,0:01:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go home until I'm wasted. {?????????????????????????????????????????????? no clue at all}{歩く姿は千鳥足; this comes from the expression 立てば貧血、座れば吐き気、歩く姿は千鳥足 which is a parody of the phrase 立てば芍薬、座れば牡丹、歩く姿は百合の花. Also worth pointing out that 千鳥足 is an expression used to describe the way drunk people walk}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.26,0:01:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.91,0:02:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.90,0:02:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.50,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All in! {??????????? no clue what ganbare could mean in this situation, probably "I bet it all on one horse" but idk how to word it in english if he doesn't even say which horse it is}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.44,0:02:22.17,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ah, watch out! Take care! {I assume that's narrator cheering him on}{I think it's supposed to be someone else in the racing stadium, but really badly placed}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.25,0:02:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.55,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Would you look at that! \NTonight I'll be... {???????????????????????????????????????????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.09,0:02:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait! I just remembered! \NI'm not really lucky when it comes to money... {???????????????????????????????????????????????????????? no clue at all what he's yapping about in these few lines, just making up something that fits}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.83,0:02:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta get some capital first. {bascially what all of that was: he was thinking of all the fun he'll have at night, then he remembers his usual bad luck when it comes to betting, but he reshapes his perception to one where he's gathering funds for his "big fortunes" predicted earlier (idk if any of that made sense, not very good at explaining thought processes}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.20,0:02:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's 30 on 2-3! {??????????????????????????? lit: 2 3 is 30 sheets} {horse betting term, remember he got a 2-1 ticket?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a long shot.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.70,0:02:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely one of today's three great fortunes.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.24,0:02:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, which horse did you bet on?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.21,0:03:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Went all in on that horse with a gait...{つらり(<- same as 全部)とした腰つきの馬じゃい }
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.23,0:03:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? I bet on that sturdy horse.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.51,0:03:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, I'm a man who is really unlucky, except with women.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.26,0:03:11.21,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Here it is, the first \Nof his three misfortunes.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.61,0:03:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just need to say the right password... "mountain."
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.07,0:03:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mountain! Mountain!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.74,0:03:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,River.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.04,0:03:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, here it comes!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.34,0:03:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! It'll land on the horse next. Let's go! {???????????????????????????????????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.84,0:03:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, come to daddy! Toldja! But that's not all yet. This time it'll land on the sheep. {??????????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.40,0:04:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I smile so much for money? {???????????????}{金銭にて笑うか}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.41,0:04:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk him into betting on the mouse next, \Nbut be discreet. {?????????}{btw doing mouse here instead of rat because 1. he uses ネズミ instead of 子 and 2. to adapt the "chuu chuu" joke}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.44,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.92,0:04:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm the goddess of good luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.92,0:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a fateful encounter,\Nyou and me meeting here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.58,0:04:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You know, I also... a-a-also think so...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.47,0:04:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to bet! \NPlease make your bet, mister!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.40,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you really make my head spin. \NCan I really do {\i1}this{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.58,0:04:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mwah...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.70,0:04:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Mwah? \NAh, you mean mouse? Okay, got it. {honestly no idea how chuu became https://jisho.org/search/%E5%AD%90%20%23kanji}{チュー is an onomatopoeia for both kissing and the squeak a rat makes}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.69,0:04:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything on the mouse? All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I lost!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.73,0:05:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So who gets the last laugh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.38,0:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible, so terrible...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.05,0:05:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who gets the last laugh.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.76,0:05:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They cheated. They cheated me out of my money! It's a scam! A racket!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.11,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What, your fortune didn't come true either?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman tricked me. {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.81,0:05:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing to a woman is pathetic. \NLet me take another look. {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.99,0:05:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, with your superior supporting you, \Nyou'll achieve great success. {?????????????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.57,0:05:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go again, leave the woman to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.54,0:05:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this time we'll win big for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.25,0:05:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm spinning it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet on the horse! {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.23,0:06:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, keep 'em coming!\NOkay, next is the rabbit!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.74,0:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.59,0:06:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my lovely, chubby boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.00,0:06:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here she comes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.86,0:06:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken this woman for myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.66,0:06:41.97,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh, but isn't it more dangerous that way?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.94,0:06:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's have a round or two together. {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.10,0:06:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So he asked me to prepare cocktails \Nin the hermit's style. And... Ah, welcome! {???????????}{仙人各店}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.92,0:06:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.37,0:07:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.75,0:07:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew! That's what I like \Nto see coming from all sides!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.18,0:07:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is the clear winner!{本命}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.06,0:07:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little unwell...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.69,0:07:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.64,0:07:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to my place after this!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.53,0:07:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd like to, but... {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.33,0:07:45.17,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be shy. {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.17,0:07:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep drinking, babe.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.18,0:07:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Won't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.58,0:07:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I have a husband.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.74,0:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What, another door in my face? {throwback to "doors on all sides are closed"}{tried to do something with that "shut the door in someone's face" idiom}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.91,0:08:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time. {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.18,0:08:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.61,0:08:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock-knock.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.94,0:08:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go in? {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.46,0:08:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, open it! {door - same throwback}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.33,0:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.83,0:08:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's no good either.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.79,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one of them is.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.36,0:08:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I really feel like all the doors are closed.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.76,0:08:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here it comes!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.67,0:08:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.51,0:08:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.03,0:09:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta be careful...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.42,0:09:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that was dangerous.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.54,0:09:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, that was close.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.94,0:09:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! The Senior Disciple is in trouble!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.46,0:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have that here. \NWhat will you do about it? {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.10,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.98,0:10:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be taking all of this as compensation, \Nalthough it's still not enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.76,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is for the smart ones. {???????????????????}{世の中は頭しだい}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.58,0:10:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what the three \Ngreat misfortunes were?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.67,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Without money or women, huh... {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.00,0:10:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try telling our fortunes once more.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.09,0:10:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our training is still insufficient.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.28,0:10:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,An incredible omen! {???????}{素晴らしい卦}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.91,0:10:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your divination tomfoolery, \Nyour fortunes will stick with you both all year round. {???????????????? I assume he means as a punishment}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All year round?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.17,0:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about my wife?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.90,0:11:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Born in the year of the monkey...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.17,0:11:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"If you fight, you always win." {戦えば常に勝つ}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.83,0:11:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this my punishment too? {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.28,0:11:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No good...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.95,0:11:19.31,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But, say, Senior Disciple, isn't fate something \Nyou carve out for yourself?
Comment: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:22.31,Narrator,,0,0,0,,
